,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":5834.135126194,"data":"3. The receiver then throws the ball back to the other team.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":5834.136119269,"data":"4. The receiving team tries to catch the ball before it hits the ground or goes out of bounds.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":5834.137062512,"data":"5. If the receiver catches the ball before it hits the ground or goes out of bounds, they score a point.\n"}
